{
  "info": {
    "name": "Car Rental API (Render - live)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Same requests as the local collection, pointed at the live Render deployment. The free Render instance sleeps when idle, so the first request can take ~1 minute. The collection can be run repeatedly: each Delete removes the record its Create made, the new customer gets a unique email, and the new rental uses a car created just for it."
